<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>7930.2U CHG 1 - Appendix A-13</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = {
  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }
};
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #000;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 60px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    margin-left: 40px;
  }
  .example-line {
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .note-block {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .example-block {
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <span>8/10/25</span>
  <span>7930.2U CHG 1</span>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">In this example, the NDB is not operational, but the marker beacon is operational.</p>
</div>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;JOSIE MKR BCN U/S</p>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">In this example, only the marker beacon is unserviceable; the NDB is operational.</p>
</div>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLES&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">!MCI MCI NAV ILS RWY 09 HUGGY LOM U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">FLV FLV NAV HUGGY NDB U/S&hellip;</p>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">In the above examples, Huggy NDB serves as a LOM to runway 9 at Kansas City Intl (MCI). It also serves Fort Leavenworth/Sherman AAF (FLV), Kansas, as an NDB.</p>
</div>

<p class="section-title">(2) [h] &nbsp;NAVAID identification change.</p>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV VORTAC ID CHANGED TO VHP&hellip;</p>
</div>

<p class="section-title">(d) Visual Glide Slope Indicator.</p>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLES&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;RWY 18 PAPI BEYOND 6DEG LEFT OF RCL UNUSABLE&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;RWY 32 PAPI BEYOND 2.8NM UNUSABLE&hellip;</p>
</div>

<p class="section-title">(f) &nbsp;Instrument Landing Systems (ILS). &nbsp;Precision.</p>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLES&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 35L U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 32 110.3 COMMISSIONED&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 08R SNOOP LOM U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 05 U/S&hellip;&minus;PERM</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 18 DME U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 02 FAN MKR U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 18 GP UNUSABLE SFC&minus;768FT &hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 02 GP/OM/MM U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 30 GP UNUSABLE BEYOND 5DEG LEFT OF COURSE &hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV BZB ILS RWY 22R U/S&hellip;</p>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">Offset ILS are issued with the 3 letter ID (example BZB) for the localizer after the Keyword NAV.</p>
</div>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 30 FAC PER CLASSIFICATION CODE CHANGED TO CLASS IIIE&hellip;</p>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">For runway 30, the ILS facility performance classification code has been changed from the previously published data.</p>
</div>

<p class="section-title">(g) &nbsp;Localizer/LOC Directional Aid/Simplified Directional Facility Azimuth.</p>

<div class="example-block">
  <p class="heading">EXAMPLES&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 30 LOC RTS&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 35L U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 12 LOC UNUSABLE BEYOND 4DEG RIGHT OF COURSE &hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV ILS RWY 12 LOC UNUSABLE BEYOND RWY THR&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV LOC RWY 27 U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV LOC RWY 33 LOC UNUSABLE WI .4NM &hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV LOC RWY 16 BC UNUSABLE BEYOND 6DEG RIGHT OF COURSE&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV LOC TYPE DIRECTIONAL AID U/S&hellip;</p>
  <p class="example-line">&hellip;NAV LOC RWY 14 LOC/DME U/S&hellip;</p>
</div>

<div class="note-block">
  <p class="heading">NOTE&minus;</p>
  <p class="example-line">The LDA at the airport, not a particular runway, is unserviceable.</p>
</div>

<div class="footer">
  <span>Examples</span>
  <span>Appendix A&minus;13</span>
</div>

</body>
</html>
